sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser
    participant L as Laravel
    participant D as MySQL

    A->>B: Login
    B->>L: POST /login
    L-->>B: Redirect ke /admin
    A->>B: Tambah course
    B->>L: POST /admin/courses
    L->>L: Middleware auth + admin, validasi input
    L->>D: INSERT courses
    L-->>B: Redirect ke daftar course
    A->>B: Tambah lesson di course
    B->>L: POST /admin/courses/{id}/lessons
    L->>D: Hitung position terakhir, INSERT lessons
    L-->>B: Redirect ke daftar lesson
    A->>B: Klik tombol naik / turun
    B->>L: PATCH /admin/lessons/{id}/move/up
    L->>D: Tukar position dengan lesson tetangga (transaksi)
    L-->>B: Kembali ke daftar lesson
